{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 126,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.16120147705078,
        526.9481811523438,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "These costs are dependent on patient volume, batching and negotiated cost per targeted",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        109.55290222167969,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "NGS kit.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        108.66522979736328,
        526.6245727539062,
        121.81022644042969
      ],
      "text": "Recognizing the lack of economic evidence on this topic, a hypothetical cost–effectiveness",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        124.16522979736328,
        527.0762329101562,
        137.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "modelling study was undertaken to assess the cost–effectiveness (Objective 1) and affordability",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.967501640319824,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        139.66522216796875,
        501.498291015625,
        152.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "(Objective 2) of these tests for the diagnosis of DR-TB in various high TB burden settings.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        163.82313537597656,
        527.162841796875,
        176.7371368408203
      ],
      "text": "Objective 1: To assess the potential cost–effectiveness of introducing the targeted NGS",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        179.32313537597656,
        451.70404052734375,
        192.2371368408203
      ],
      "text": "technology for the diagnosis of DR-TB in Georgia, India and South Africa.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        201.67303466796875,
        526.9666137695312,
        214.8180389404297
      ],
      "text": "This assessment included modelling the cost–effectiveness of targeted NGS in three separate",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        215.67303466796875,
        282.32708740234375,
        228.8180389404297
      ],
      "text": "scenarios with distinct comparison options:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        235.42498779296875,
        526.6192016601562,
        248.5699920654297
      ],
      "text": "a)\t Cost–effectiveness of targeted NGS for DST among individuals with RR-TB after a rapid",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        250.92498779296875,
        502.07489013671875,
        264.07000732421875
      ],
      "text": "molecular test for rifampicin resistance as a replacement for phenotypic DST (PICO 2).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        274.92889404296875,
        526.6181030273438,
        288.07391357421875
      ],
      "text": "b)\tCost–effectiveness of targeted NGS for DST among individuals with RR-TB after a rapid",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        290.42889404296875,
        526.6866455078125,
        303.57391357421875
      ],
      "text": "molecular test for rifampicin resistance as a replacement for current in-country DST practice",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.986291885375977,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        305.92889404296875,
        127.45479583740234,
        319.07391357421875
      ],
      "text": "(PICO 2).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        329.93292236328125,
        526.9613647460938,
        343.07794189453125
      ],
      "text": "c)\t Cost–effectiveness of targeted NGS as the initial test for TB drug resistance in patients with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        345.43292236328125,
        526.9653930664062,
        358.57794189453125
      ],
      "text": "bacteriologically confirmed TB compared with rapid molecular testing for drug resistance",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        360.93292236328125,
        381.30877685546875,
        374.07794189453125
      ],
      "text": "and phenotypic DST in a high DR-TB burden setting (PICO 1).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        384.9367980957031,
        527.28125,
        398.0818176269531
      ],
      "text": "In the first scenario, targeted NGS was compared with universal phenotypic DST; in the second",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.989144325256348,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        400.4367980957031,
        526.636474609375,
        413.5818176269531
      ],
      "text": "scenario, targeted NGS was compared with current in-country phenotypic DST practice among",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.979331016540527,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        415.9367980957031,
        526.9371337890625,
        429.0818176269531
      ],
      "text": "individuals with detected rifampicin resistance (PICO 2). This was done across three countries:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        431.4367980957031,
        526.7522583007812,
        444.5818176269531
      ],
      "text": "Georgia, India and South Africa. Current DST practice in Georgia and South Africa includes Xpert",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.946670532226562,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        446.9173889160156,
        526.9436645507812,
        460.0818176269531
      ],
      "text": "® XDR  followed by phenotypic DST; in India it includes LPAs and phenotypic DST done in parallel.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.964492797851562,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        462.4367980957031,
        527.0145263671875,
        475.5818176269531
      ],
      "text": "A final scenario included targeted NGS compared to rapid molecular testing for drug resistance",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.9679536819458,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        477.9367980957031,
        526.4927978515625,
        491.0818176269531
      ],
      "text": "and phenotypic DST as initial tests for TB drug resistance among all TB patients (PICO 1) but was",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.964141845703125,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.4367980957031,
        526.93701171875,
        506.5818176269531
      ],
      "text": "modelled for only one setting, Georgia – a high DR-TB burden setting. Epidemiological data",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        508.936767578125,
        526.926025390625,
        522.081787109375
      ],
      "text": "were sourced from published literature; targeted NGS diagnostic accuracy data were sourced",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        524.436767578125,
        527.01953125,
        537.581787109375
      ],
      "text": "from the systematic review and IDP analysis conducted for this guideline. Economic data were",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.99940013885498,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        539.936767578125,
        526.98095703125,
        553.081787109375
      ],
      "text": "sourced from published literature and a systematic and scoping review done in parallel by our",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        555.436767578125,
        341.7594909667969,
        568.581787109375
      ],
      "text": "team and supplemented with empirical data collection.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        579.440673828125,
        527.2213134765625,
        592.585693359375
      ],
      "text": "A decision analysis modelling approach was used to estimate the incremental cost–effectiveness",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        594.940673828125,
        527.3299560546875,
        608.085693359375
      ],
      "text": "of using targeted NGS for the diagnosis of DR-TB compared with various existing DST scenarios.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.965546607971191,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        610.440673828125,
        527.1181640625,
        623.585693359375
      ],
      "text": "This was done from the perspective of the health care system and accounts only for the health",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.998600006103516,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        625.940673828125,
        526.7446899414062,
        639.085693359375
      ],
      "text": "care system costs required to diagnose and treat TB. The estimation did not account for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        641.440673828125,
        527.0031127929688,
        654.585693359375
      ],
      "text": "societal costs, or any direct or indirect costs incurred by patients. In addition, costs for sample",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        656.940673828125,
        526.9700927734375,
        670.085693359375
      ],
      "text": "transportation were not included in this analysis. The primary outcome was the incremental",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        672.440673828125,
        526.9645385742188,
        685.585693359375
      ],
      "text": "cost–effectiveness ratio (ICER), which was calculated as the incremental cost in US dollars per",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        687.940673828125,
        281.2410583496094,
        701.085693359375
      ],
      "text": "disability-adjusted life year (DALY) averted.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        712.9283447265625,
        409.7881774902344,
        727.0162963867188
      ],
      "text": "Main findings for PICO 1: Using targeted NGS as an initial test",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        737.6832275390625,
        526.9588623046875,
        750.8282470703125
      ],
      "text": "Using targeted NGS as an initial test for DST in the high DR-TB burden setting of Georgia led",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        753.1832275390625,
        527.0140380859375,
        766.3282470703125
      ],
      "text": "to more health gains (DALYs=0.49) compared with Xpert MTB/RIF or Xpert Ultra, followed by",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        38.466400146484375,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "110 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.0803985595703,
        802.0169067382812,
        288.38323974609375,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Fourth edition",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}